{
 "description": "Watch apps (build 162): quote parsing per exchange (Binance ticker/24hr with symbols=[...], Bybit v5/market/tickers?category=spot&symbol=, OKX v5/market/ticker?instId= - single-symbol answers, only wanted coins, price > 0, Bybit price24hPcnt x 100, OKX change = last vs open24h), fallback (Binance for all coins in one request, then only the missing coins one request each at Bybit, then OKX; null response = HTTP error/blocked; request keys binance / bybit:<SYMBOL> / okx:<INST-ID>, compared as a set because requests per exchange run in parallel; expected in coin order), at most 8 coins (WatchCoins.MAX), freshness (WatchFreshness: outdated when the last successful fetch is older than OutdatedRule.afterMillis(15) = 45 min, strictly more; age unit/count like A11ySpeech.age: under 1 min justNow, then minutes, hours, days; time 0 = never loaded). Android wear WatchQuotes/WatchPriceSource + marketdata WatchFreshness, iOS WatchCore WatchQuoteParser/WatchQuoteFetch/WatchFreshness.",
